Testing/release reporting discipline:

Never use these terms interchangeably:
- Source changed
- Compiled
- Flashed
- Bench verified
- Release verified

For substantial changes, report exactly:
- STARTING SHA
- ENDING SHA
- FILES CHANGED
- TARGETS AFFECTED
- COMPILE STATUS
- FLASH STATUS
- BENCH TEST STATUS
- ACCEPTANCE TEST STATUS
- UNRELATED DIRTY FILES PRESERVED

Do not fabricate outcomes.
